#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:5 2cd1214ef8414eefb57773de449c6546
msgid "Introduction to Sub"
msgstr "水下机器人（Sub）简介"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:13 b38144114c624db797fff0547a7bb205
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sub is an advanced open-source autopilot system for submersible ROVs "
"(Remote Operated Vehicle) that supports multiple vehicle configurations. "
"It offers a variety of operating modes from fully manual to fully "
"autonomous, and is designed to be safe, feature-rich, open-ended, and "
"easy to use even for novice users."
msgstr "Sub 是一款先进的开源自动驾驶系统，适用于潜水式水下机器人（ROV），支持多种飞行器配置，提供从完全手动到完全自主的多种操作模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:19 812ace434044492e9fb3e2f33c623a5d
msgid "Swim Features"
msgstr "游泳（水下运动）功能"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:21 89e5f347630e4394b80b2276763e2bd5
msgid ""
"A robust Attitude and Heading Reference System (AHRS), powered by sensor "
"fusion and inertial navigation algorithms (:ref:`EKF <common-apm-"
"navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview>`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:22 e8f98356d5c34a208bebc5a0f4f2ca19
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Automatic Attitude Stabilization, Depth Control, and Position Control "
"(assuming configuration and installed sensors allow it)"
msgstr "自动姿态稳定、深度控制、位置控制（前提是配置和已安装的传感器允许）"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:23 29daa289fa4b4f37b81895395a2e2069
msgid "Fully Autonomous Missions, see :ref:`common-mission-planning`"
msgstr "完全自主任务，参见 :ref:`common-mission-planning`"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:24 b268f3fda5bf46bc8945cbe2aed0bfb2
msgid ""
"Configurable Failsafes for system component failures, see :ref:`failsafe-"
"landing-page`"
msgstr "可配置的系统组件失控保护，参见 :ref:`failsafe-landing-page`"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:25 68a3c3ab572e42d997960c53e8cc5250
msgid "Subsurface Terrain Following and Surface Tracking, see :ref:`modes`"
msgstr "水下地形跟随和水面跟踪，参见 :ref:`modes`"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:26 e4a21044185140b58747e57ed8fc863a
msgid "Extensive GCS Button Action Support, see :ref:`buttons`"
msgstr "丰富的地面站按钮动作支持，参见 :ref:`buttons`"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:28 90c523a95e9b42bba868bca2212de9f0
msgid ""
"As part of the broader :ref:`ArduPilot<ardupilot:home>` platform, "
"utilities like :ref:`simulators <dev:simulation-2>`, :ref:`Ground Control"
" Station (GCS) <common-GCS>` software, and :ref:`log analysis tools "
"<common-logs>` are also available. These can aid in preparing for "
"operations, executing them, and analysing their outcomes and data "
"afterwards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:31 81fc55d39e7a41669886cc8a9ac4c31e
msgid "Vehicle Configuration Options"
msgstr "飞行器配置选项"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:33 f2080a327b1b4565b41c6a33d4787950
msgid ""
"Sub provides access to many functionalities through its fine-grained "
":ref:`parameter set <parameters>`, including:"
msgstr ""

