"Bi-directional propulsion motors/thrusters, with brushed or brushless "
"construction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:36 e1cc86e2e8284dcdb757dbf4c285737d
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Built-in :ref:`frame configurations <sub-frames>` for 3/4/5/6 or 8 "
"thrusters, controlling up to all 6 degrees of vehicular motion and axial "
"rotation"
