msgstr "以太网飞行器外设连接选项，适用于侧扫声呐等精密传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:50 4c1cfd129bda42b0b85fa4a2038786d7
msgid "100's of ArduPilot compatible autopilots to choose from"
msgstr "数百款兼容 ArduPilot 的飞控可供选择"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:51 c271c665893943388ab016d844595428
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Optional Linux based :ref:`companion computer<dev:companion-computers>` "
"interface to autopilot for simplified configuration, and advanced "
"functionality like image and beacon data processing, sonar displays in "
"the GCS, custom applications, etc."
msgstr "可选基于 Linux 的伴侣计算机与飞控接口，用于图像处理、信标数据处理、地面站声呐显示、自定义应用等"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:53 742fdb78325f457f93e1ce4ded919121
